# `iff` returns the second argument when true and the third when false or null.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/edge/nulls.csv'
| project id, big = iff(value > 2, 'big', 'small'), num = iff(id > 2, id, 2.5)
| sort by id asc
---- expected
id   | big    | num
long | string | real
-----+--------+-----
   1 | small  |  2.5
   2 | big    |  2.5
   3 | small  |  3.0
   4 | big    |  4.0
   5 | small  |  5.0
